    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Y1 \u00b7 Type A**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/releases/download/2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7/rom-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/releases/download/2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7/rom-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/releases/download/2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7/rom-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# 2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.7\n\nKoensayr is a mod for the Y1's OS that makes the following improvements to the original OS:\n\nBrowsing the albums of an artist from Main Menu > Artists > Albums\n\nAdds Bluetooth remote control support and track info displayed on your bluetooth receiver, perfect for using your Y1 in a car with the infotainment system.\n\n\n---\n\n## Build metadata\n\nPatched **rom.zip** built from stock **3.0.7** by [koensayr-auto](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto) v2.4.0.\n\n## Upstream\n\n- Repository: [`y1-community/y1-stock-rom`](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-stock-rom)\n- Release tag: `Latest-3.0.7`\n- Asset: `rom.zip`\n- Upstream SHA256: `7cbffcbe7dc1beb823e9ab8d37cea6120d16856bba49e02ed2d6e1548832e695`\n\n## Koensayr build\n\n- Version: `2.4.0`\n- Git revision: `16f65333696597b084d34931d4c94f7c5352e9e5` (includes `com.innioasis.y1` APK patches under `src/patches/`)\n\n## Build output\n\n- Patched `rom.zip` SHA256: `b5b8cfbb651460e989a2cfb93a4f9b5e610a76015103e69bac382ba65f9bf97a` (see `build-manifest.json` on this release)\n- Upstream `rom.zip` was re-hashed at build time; output must differ (CI enforces this).\n\n## Patches (`--all`)\n\n- Music-player UX (Artist\u2192Album navigation)\n- Bluetooth pairing (`audio.conf` / `auto_pairing.conf` / `blacklist.conf` / `build.prop`)\n- System config (ADB debugging, bloatware removal)\n- Root (`/system/xbin/su`, mode 06755)\n- AVRCP 1.3 metadata + control + Y1Bridge\n\nDiagnostic scripts (`tools/dual-capture.sh`, gdb attach, `btlog-dump`) are **not** included in the ROM \u2014 see the repo [Diagnostics](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto#diagnostics).\n\n## After flash\n\nIf AVRCP / MultiDex classes fail to load after upgrading from a prior koensayr build:\n\n```bash\nadb shell rm -rf /data/data/com.innioasis.y1/code_cache/secondary-dexes/\n```\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"9854d29ce2e21882a0fdc91c183e32e5f8a01b939e4f4814ee7d51aa26daab2e\",\"size\":625664623,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"a18a77bed2efdd90d232c40768a32e77e7f14b33e333851bbaabafe61cf17ff0\",\"size\":359631921,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"26bc0c9054aca10d0e5337dcb19416b51d8ef9b18f35defaaeff2652c3c7727c\",\"size\":444175641,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-08T20:01:46Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"e43b9acd63cdbf16fbd6c0688c0ca2138a651b002661ca3242686bf0c97ce85f\",\"original_assets\":[\"build-manifest.json\",\"rom.zip\"],\"skipped\":[],\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"build-manifest.json\":9,\"rom-linux.zip\":1,\"rom-macos.zip\":3,\"rom-windows.zip\":1,\"rom.zip\":9},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-08T20:01:46Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Linux-Portable.zip\",\"size\":387920108,\"tag\":\"2.5.1\"},\"macos\":{\"name\":\"Innioasis.Updater.for.Mac.dmg\",\"size\":119787348,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"},\"windows\":{\"name\":\"UpdaterCE-Windows-Portable.zip\",\"size\":205854850,\"tag\":\"2.5.3\"}},\"v\":11} -->\n",
